{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265FnzfVmGYs1795183995.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>北角社區客廳開幕，是今年第10間投入服務的社區客廳。</p><p></p><p>客廳面積2,400平方呎，設有煮食區，洗衣機，以及兒童遊戲區，有小朋友在場玩耍。客廳由太古提供場地，聖雅各福群會營運，預計可服務區內270個劏房戶，全年服務43,000人次。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIVINGROOM-2100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UxLm2Xflzg1795184004.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>政務司司長陳國基、勞福局局長孫玉菡出席開幕禮，並且參觀了客廳設施。陳國基稱，政府會繼續透過政策引導及跨界別合作，令社區客廳紮根社區，持續發展及不斷優化服務。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:23:58.554155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:37:14.216163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:19.419526+00:00","content_hash":"e2bfdac1e4fb1b8b79ef35223e1981b45aaf4ab7bf41c1fca6972c8e3b3fd518","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:23:58.554155+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}